assert find_Majority_Element([1, 1, 2, 2, 2]) == 2
assert find_Majority_Element([5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 5]) == 5

## Canonical Elixir names (use verbatim)
- Module: `Solution`
- Function: `find_majority_element`

